    <summary>Simple, nag-free control for Windows 11 Defender.</summary>
    <description>ShieldSheriff is a lightweight Windows 11 Defender configuration tool.
It keeps Microsoft Defender under your chosen settings (Real-Time Protection, Behavior Monitoring, IOAV, Script Scanning, Network Protection, Cloud Protection, and Sample Submission), silences Windows Security Center nags, auto-heals configuration drift, and supports timed or process-aware protection pauses from the Dashboard, System Tray, or CLI.</description>
